<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA 39-2 VS SRI LANKA AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 39-2 VS SRI LANKA AT LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, replying to Sri Lanka's first innings score of 332, were 39 for two at lunch on the second day of the second and final test match in Colombo on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 1st innings 332 (A de Silva 146, D.Mohanty 4-78); India 1st innings 39-2 (N.Siddhu not out 16, S.Tendulkar not out 19).</p>
